# Vercel reads THIS file and ignores .gitignore entirely. Anything not listed
# here gets uploaded by `vercel deploy` from a working tree -- which is how
# .claude/ and other private files have ended up publicly served before.
# Keep this a SUPERSET of .gitignore.
#
# The site is web/ only (vercel.json sets outputDirectory: web). Everything
# below is build tooling, raw data, or local state and must never ship.

# --- everything from .gitignore ---
/data/
web/data/
.env
.env.*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.playwright-mcp/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
test-results/
.wrangler/
node_modules/

# --- local/private state ---
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- pipeline source: public on GitHub, but not part of the website ---
*.py
tests/
config.yaml
requirements.txt
requirements-test.txt

# --- docs / notes ---
*.md
